          "system_name": "SUSE CVE Page",
          "text": "https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12055"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "A vulnerability in Ollama versions \u003c=0.3.14 allows a malicious user to create a customized gguf model file that can be uploaded to the public Ollama server. When the server processes this malicious model, it crashes, leading to a Denial of Service (DoS) attack. The root cause of the issue is an out-of-bounds read in the gguf.go file.",
          "title": "CVE description"
        }
      ],
      "product_status": {
        "recommended": [
